canvas 520 280
label "The agent lane: a declared agent with a model, tasks, types, a channel and a budget runs as refresh, reads the published surfaces, and opens a proposal (highlighted) that carries provenance and an episode with its cost; the proposal passes the lints and the auto-merge guards, or is rejected before any lint runs when it steps outside its declared types"
caption "The highlighted proposal is the only thing an agent lane can produce; a write to the branch is impossible by construction, and the budget stops the lane for the month."
box decl 16 30 150 80 "agents[] entry|model · tasks · types|channel · budget"
box run 206 30 120 80 "refresh --agent|reads surfaces,|calls the model"
box prop 366 30 138 80 "proposal|prov: ai-generated|+ episode with usage" acc
arrow decl run
arrow run prop
box guard 206 150 120 60 "declared types|and tasks? budget?"
box lints 366 150 138 60 "lints at error,|auto-merge guards"
box rej 16 150 150 60 "rejected: E509|skipped: E510"
arrow prop guard
arrow guard lints
arrow guard rej
note "never a write — every output is a proposal; the build stays model-free"
